/E (Non-dilutive funding accounts for $45.7B in 2024, but nearly half stems from just 10 giga-rounds \($1B+\), highlighting a focus on scalable, later-stage projects. Global equity funding fell 14% year-over-year, driven by a decline in emerging markets. However, the US showed resilience with a 4% funding increase, and Europe saw only a modest 3% decline, reflecting stability in the two most funded regions.)
