<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Long due diligence processes was mentioned as a challenging factor by nearly double the percent of North American innovators than by Europeans. Regulatory uncertainties and lengthy due-diligence processes were major challenges in the Food, Agriculture, and Water sectors due to extensive government oversight. )
/E (Long due diligence processes was mentioned as a challenging factor by nearly double the percent of North American innovators than by Europeans. Regulatory uncertainties and lengthy due-diligence processes were major challenges in the Food, Agriculture, and Water sectors due to extensive government oversight. )
