5960 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (Innovators with hardware solutions frequently cited a lack of industry-specific investors as a challenge, while insufficient investor interest was the most common issue among software-focused innovators. This reflects the funding disparity between hardware and software solutions in recent years and highlights the perceived scarcity of hardware-specialized investors.)
/E (Innovators with hardware solutions frequently cited a lack of industry-specific investors as a challenge, while insufficient investor interest was the most common issue among software-focused innovators. This reflects the funding disparity between hardware and software solutions in recent years and highlights the perceived scarcity of hardware-specialized investors.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 69 0 R
/K [32]
>>
endobj
5961 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (The lack of industry-specific investors was the most common challenge across developmental stages, except for the idea/concept and established/scaling stages. In the established/scaling stage, valuation disagreements were reported by two-thirds of respondents, underscoring heightened risk perceptions in this phase.)
