7186 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (How does EDP Ventures collaborate with other industry players and Corporate Venture Capitals to discover and co-invest in climate tech startups?)
/E (How does EDP Ventures collaborate with other industry players and Corporate Venture Capitals to discover and co-invest in climate tech startups?)
/Alt ()
/Pg 103 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
7187 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (At EDP Ventures, we prioritize partnerships with VC and CVC firms, including utilities, to drive climate innovation. These collaborations help us identify startups, share insights, and co-invest in climate tech. Regular discussions allow us to explore opportunities and manage risks with CVCs. Also, through Free Electrons \(EDP Innovation acceleration program in coordination with 6 other global power utilities\) we partner with industry leaders to support startups, build pilot projects, and source dealflow. These partnerships enhance our support for startups and advance climate solutions.)
/E (At EDP Ventures, we prioritize partnerships with VC and CVC firms, including utilities, to drive climate innovation. These collaborations help us identify startups, share insights, and co-invest in climate tech. Regular discussions allow us to explore opportunities and manage risks with CVCs. Also, through Free Electrons \(EDP Innovation acceleration program in coordination with 6 other global power utilities\) we partner with industry leaders to support startups, build pilot projects, and source dealflow. These partnerships enhance our support for startups and advance climate solutions.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 103 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
