<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (There are more and more people at urban areas, thus large construction developments are already being a megatrend in the industry. That means that delivering enough construction materials efficiently and on time is becoming a challenge. Besides, we are also going to start seeing scarcity of few natural resources such as natural aggregates or water, thus making sure the access to these components through a strong value chain is key for manufacturers and construction managers.)
/E (There are more and more people at urban areas, thus large construction developments are already being a megatrend in the industry. That means that delivering enough construction materials efficiently and on time is becoming a challenge. Besides, we are also going to start seeing scarcity of few natural resources such as natural aggregates or water, thus making sure the access to these components through a strong value chain is key for manufacturers and construction managers.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 107 0 R
/K [9]
>>
