7446 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (What key challenges do you anticipate in the future, and how do you plan to leverage collaboration with Climate Tech startups to address them?)
/E (What key challenges do you anticipate in the future, and how do you plan to leverage collaboration with Climate Tech startups to address them?)
/Alt ()
/Pg 110 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
7447 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Key challenges will be speed to adapt new technologies to reduce emissions. Often industries like the ones of our customers are very conservative as they deal with processes which are very delicate and can be dangerous if not handled with the corresponding experience. So we need to find ways to speed up the transition without compromising on safety and regulations. )
/E (Key challenges will be speed to adapt new technologies to reduce emissions. Often industries like the ones of our customers are very conservative as they deal with processes which are very delicate and can be dangerous if not handled with the corresponding experience. So we need to find ways to speed up the transition without compromising on safety and regulations. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 110 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
