<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (InnoEnergy focuses on investing in sustainable energy innovations. How do you evaluate the long-term impact and scalability of projects working on breakthrough technologies in clean energy?)
/E (InnoEnergy focuses on investing in sustainable energy innovations. How do you evaluate the long-term impact and scalability of projects working on breakthrough technologies in clean energy?)
/Alt ()
/Pg 118 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
7679 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Every two years, we measure the impact of emissions avoided at the portfolio level and publish a comprehensive impact report. However, because we typically invest at a very early stage, we do not precisely quantify the impact of every new investment. Instead, we assess the general potential of the problem being addressed by the company and the size of the target market, considering both its dollar value and its potential for emission avoidance. Hence, we are not afraid to include in our strategy such ambitious and long-term projects such as nuclear fusion and hyperloop technologies.)
/E (Every two years, we measure the impact of emissions avoided at the portfolio level and publish a comprehensive impact report. However, because we typically invest at a very early stage, we do not precisely quantify the impact of every new investment. Instead, we assess the general potential of the problem being addressed by the company and the size of the target market, considering both its dollar value and its potential for emission avoidance. Hence, we are not afraid to include in our strategy such ambitious and long-term projects such as nuclear fusion and hyperloop technologies.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 118 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
