7872 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (For Greentown, success is measured by our startups' growth, deployment, and impact on emissions reduction and resilience. We track metrics like project count, revenue, and technology stage, but prioritize companies with high impact potential by 2050. Startups estimate CO2e reductions their solution could achieve and report milestone progress via surveys. Notable alumni include Form Energy, Sublime Systems, Fervo Energy, Via Separations, ZwitterCo, Cemvita Factory, and American Battery Technology Company.)
/E (For Greentown, success is measured by our startups' growth, deployment, and impact on emissions reduction and resilience. We track metrics like project count, revenue, and technology stage, but prioritize companies with high impact potential by 2050. Startups estimate CO2e reductions their solution could achieve and report milestone progress via surveys. Notable alumni include Form Energy, Sublime Systems, Fervo Energy, Via Separations, ZwitterCo, Cemvita Factory, and American Battery Technology Company.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 123 0 R
/K [14]
>>
